               lowercase for black pieces (e.g., 'p', 'r', 'n', 'b', 'q', 'k'), and '' for empty squares.
               The board is oriented with index [0] as rank 8 and [7] as rank 1.
               Column indices [0] to [7] correspond to files 'a' to 'h'.
